如果你是要查 SQL Server 哪些 View 有使用到某個 Table，有幾種方式。

方法一：查 sys.sql_expression_dependencies (推薦)

假設要找有沒有 View 用到 Customer_Migrate_buffer：

SELECT
    OBJECT_SCHEMA_NAME(referencing_id) AS SchemaName,
    OBJECT_NAME(referencing_id) AS ViewName
FROM sys.sql_expression_dependencies
WHERE referenced_entity_name = 'Customer_Migrate_buffer'
AND OBJECTPROPERTY(referencing_id, 'IsView') = 1;

如果知道 Schema，可以一起加：

SELECT
    OBJECT_SCHEMA_NAME(referencing_id) AS SchemaName,
    OBJECT_NAME(referencing_id) AS ViewName
FROM sys.sql_expression_dependencies
WHERE referenced_schema_name = 'dbo'
AND referenced_entity_name = 'Customer_Migrate_buffer'
AND OBJECTPROPERTY(referencing_id, 'IsView') = 1;

⸻

方法二：直接搜尋 View 定義 (最常用)

有些 dependency 沒更新，直接搜尋文字比較準。

SELECT
    s.name AS SchemaName,
    v.name AS ViewName
FROM sys.views v
JOIN sys.schemas s
    ON v.schema_id = s.schema_id
JOIN sys.sql_modules m
    ON v.object_id = m.object_id
WHERE m.definition LIKE '%Customer_Migrate_buffer%';

這個會把所有 SQL 內容有出現 Customer_Migrate_buffer 的 View 找出來。

⸻

方法三：使用 SSMS

1. 展開 Database
2. 展開 Views
3. 右鍵某個 View → View Dependencies (檢視相依性)

不過這個只能一個一個看，不適合大量查詢。

⸻

我建議

如果是工作上要確認「哪個 View 用到某個 Table」，我通常會先跑 方法二 (sys.sql_modules)，因為即使相依性沒有更新、用了 Dynamic SQL 或某些特殊寫法，也比較容易找到。

如果你們是 SQL Server 2019 或 2022，這也是我最常用的查法。




# ===================================================
# SQL Server Export CSV (UTF-8 with Quoted Fields)
# ===================================================

$SERVER = "amlist"
$DB = "BSADBTW"
$TABLE = "dbo.Customer_Migrate_buffer_uat202607"

$USER = "aml"
$PASS = "aml1234"

$OUTDIR = "D:\AML_Source\Source\1141923"
$FINAL_CSV = "$OUTDIR\SK_CIF.csv"


# Create folder
if (!(Test-Path $OUTDIR)) {
    New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $OUTDIR | Out-Null
}


Write-Host "==================================================="
Write-Host " SQL Server Export CSV UTF-8"
Write-Host "==================================================="


# SQL Connection
$connectionString = "Server=$SERVER;Database=$DB;User Id=$USER;Password=$PASS;TrustServerCertificate=True;"


$query = @"
SELECT *
FROM $TABLE
"@


Write-Host "[1/2] Query SQL Server..."


$conn = New-Object System.Data.SqlClient.SqlConnection
$conn.ConnectionString = $connectionString

$conn.Open()


$cmd = $conn.CreateCommand()
$cmd.CommandText = $query


$adapter = New-Object System.Data.SqlClient.SqlDataAdapter $cmd

$table = New-Object System.Data.DataTable

$adapter.Fill($table) | Out-Null


$conn.Close()


Write-Host "Rows:" $table.Rows.Count


Write-Host "[2/2] Export CSV UTF-8..."


$table |
Export-Csv `
    -Path $FINAL_CSV `
    -NoTypeInformation `
    -Encoding UTF8


Write-Host ""
Write-Host "==================================================="
Write-Host " Export Success"
Write-Host $FINAL_CSV
Write-Host "==================================================="

pause